            "review_text": "geordie_traveller\nNewcastle upon Tyne, United Kingdom62 contributions\n0\nNot what we expected\nApr 2018 • Couples\nOur first banh mi of the trip didn't go how we expected, we read how the owner won MasterChef Vietnam a couple of years ago so expected awesomeness.. \n\nWe ordered two beef but received an egg and hotdog banh mi, fair enough mistakes happen especially with language barrier, unfortunately it was no more than an omelette sandwich which I could of made at home. Didn't taste authentic at all, even we had the beef don't think we would of been impressed. Way nicer out there.\n\nSorry won't return.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 1, 2018",
